#: ../../../source/The-ROS2-Project/Contributing/Documentation/Creating-or-updating-documentation.rst:19
msgid ""
"You can check for open documentation issues in the `issues list <https://"
"github.com/ros2/ros2_documentation/issues>`__. You must build and test the "
"documentation site before pushing your changes to GitHub. We recommend that "
"you do this locally, using the available tools in the repository makefile. "
"Alternatively, you can also build and test in GitHub Codespaces, or by using "
"a Devcontainer."
msgstr ""

