#: ../../../source/The-ROS2-Project/Contributing/Documentation/Creating-or-updating-documentation.rst:249
msgid "Using the live server"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/The-ROS2-Project/Contributing/Documentation/Creating-or-updating-documentation.rst:251
msgid ""
"While working on the ROS documentation, instead of re-running ``make html`` "
"and refreshing the browser after every edit, use the live server to watch "
"the source files, rebuild incrementally on save, and serve the result with "
"automatic browser reload."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/The-ROS2-Project/Contributing/Documentation/Creating-or-updating-documentation.rst:253
msgid ""
"The live server uses `sphinx-autobuild <https://github.com/sphinx-doc/sphinx-"
